  "html": "<h1>DataGrid</h1>\n<p><code>DataGrid</code> is a virtualized table component for working with large data sets.\nIt supports configurable columns, grouped rows, summaries, selection, context\nmenus, and data sources that can load or query rows on demand.</p>\n<h2 id=\"tabular-data\">Tabular data</h2>\n<p>The demo below uses an <code>ArrayDataSource</code> with 100,000 generated orders. It starts\nwithout grouping or sorting. Click a column header to sort, or drag a column\ninto the group panel to group the rows. Quantity and Total amount are summed\nin the total footer across the complete filtered result, and within each group\nwhen grouping is applied.</p>\n<p>Quantity uses <code>displayFormat: &quot;N0&quot;</code>, Unit price uses <code>&quot;N2&quot;</code>, and Total amount\nuses <code>&quot;C2€&quot;</code>, inheriting the grid’s <code>locale: &quot;bg-BG&quot;</code>: thousands are separated, decimals\nuse a comma, and euro amounts have two fraction digits. Group summaries and\nthe total footer reuse these formats. IDs remain unformatted. See\n<a href=\"?!=/data/formatting\">Numbers, dates and formatting</a> for the supported patterns.</p>\n<p>The demo uses <code>columnWidthMode: &quot;fixed&quot;</code>: columns do not stretch to fill spare\nspace, and manual resizing changes only the chosen column (<code>independent</code> by\ndefault in this mode). Horizontal scrolling keeps additional columns accessible.</p>\n<div data-live-demo=\"datagrid-overview\"></div>\n<p>The minimal configuration specifies a data source and columns:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> grid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataGrid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data: rows,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  columns: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dataType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dataType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"totalAmount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dataType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">refresh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"hierarchical-data\">Hierarchical data</h2>\n<p>For parent/child data, configure the <code>ArrayDataSource</code> with its <code>parentField</code>.\nThe dedicated <a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/tree\">tree data topic</a> demonstrates a\nfile-system style hierarchy.</p>\n<h2 id=\"explore-datagrid-features\">Explore DataGrid features</h2>\n<p>Scrollbars default to <code>scrollbarMode: &quot;thin&quot;</code>: a thin thumb stays visible and expands\nwithin <code>scrollbarHoverDistance</code> (default <code>50px</code>) of its edge or while dragging,\nbut stays thin during scrolling.\nUse <code>&quot;auto&quot;</code> to hide them at rest or <code>&quot;always&quot;</code> for full\nwidth. The <a href=\"?!=/components/scroll-engine\">Scroll Engine demo</a> compares all three modes.</p>\n<p>Continue with the focused topics:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/columns\">Columns and layout</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/sorting\">Sorting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/filtering\">Filtering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/grouping\">Grouping</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/summaries\">Summaries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/selection\">Selection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/editing\">Cell editing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/data-sources\">Data sources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/custom-cell-rendering\">Custom cell rendering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/context-menus\">Context menus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"?!=/components/datagrid/performance\">Virtualization and performance</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference\">API reference</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"?!=/api-reference/DataGrid\"><code>DataGrid</code> API reference</a>,\n<a href=\"?!=/api-reference/DataGridOptions\"><code>DataGridOptions</code></a>,\n<a href=\"?!=/api-reference/ArrayDataSource\"><code>ArrayDataSource</code></a>,\n<a href=\"?!=/api-reference/DataSource\"><code>DataSource</code></a>, and\n<a href=\"?!=/api-reference/SummaryDefinition\"><code>SummaryDefinition</code></a>.</p>\n",
